      hu: ["New Plymouth-t 1783-ban alapították az amerikai függetlenségi háború lojalista menekültjei.", "A kikötő a helyi homárhalász flotta legfontosabb rakodóhelye.", "A kompok óránként közlekednek Treasure Cay és Green Turtle Cay között.", "A dokk közelében található az Albert Lowe Múzeum, amely a hajóépítés történetét mutatja be.", "A 19. században a sziget jelentős ananászexportáló központ volt.", "A 2019-es Dorian hurrikán után a dokkot és a környező mólókat teljesen felújították."],
      ro: ["New Plymouth a fost fondat în 1783 de refugiați loialiști din timpul Războiului de Independență al SUA.", "Portul este principalul centru de descărcare pentru flota locală de pescuit homari.", "Feriboturile circulă la intervale regulate între Treasure Cay și Green Turtle Cay.", "Lângă debarcader se află Muzeul Albert Lowe, care documentează istoria construcției de nave.", "În secolul al XIX-lea, insula a fost un centru important pentru exportul de ananas.", "Debarcaderul a beneficiat de reparații majore după trecerea uraganului Dorian în 2019."],
      en: ["New Plymouth was established in 1783 by Loyalist refugees following the American Revolutionary War.", "The dock is the primary offloading point for the local commercial lobster fishing fleet.", "Regular ferry services run between the mainland at Treasure Cay and Green Turtle Cay.", "The nearby Albert Lowe Museum is housed in a restored 19th-century Victorian home.", "During the 1800s, Green Turtle Cay was a major center for the Bahamian pineapple industry.", "The public dock infrastructure was significantly upgraded following damage from Hurricane Dorian in 2019."],
