      en: ["The plant processes thousands of pounds of spiny lobster and grouper annually.", "It is one of the largest private-sector employers in North Eleuthera.", "The commercial lobster fishing season officially opens on August 1st each year.", "The facility uses industrial-grade flash-freezing technology for international shipping.", "Regular inspections are conducted by the Department of Marine Resources to ensure compliance.", "The plant supports the livelihoods of over 50 independent fishing vessels in the area."],
